  "goodToKnow": "Die Ausschreibung is an invitation to tender: Public contracts in Germany above certain values must be put out in a public Ausschreibung so that firms can bid. It's also a job posting: die Stellenausschreibung. Ausschreiben means to advertise, and also to write out in full: Bitte schreiben Sie Ihren Vornamen aus (don't abbreviate). Eine Wahl ausschreiben means to call an election. Plural: die Ausschreibungen."
